{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Warfare 3 is the next evolution of the acclaimed tower defense series. Lay out terrain tiles, carve perilous pathways, and customize your domain to create a perfectly tuned gauntlet of mayhem and misery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419220/extras/b70cbf09a1789a95d25c756f4718ed57.poster.avif?t=1767088236\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419220/extras/b70cbf09a1789a95d25c756f4718ed57.webm?t=1767088236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419220/extras/b70cbf09a1789a95d25c756f4718ed57.mp4?t=1767088236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your arsenal of traps and contraptions is deadlier than ever, featuring more methods of maiming, mangling, and misdirecting your foes. Every successful defense grants you valuable experience to permanently strengthen your tools of torment. Experiment with newfound synergy between traps and terrain, adapt on the fly to relentless waves of adventurers, and tailor the difficulty to your liking with a refined rune system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419220/extras/46dac60bcf814e0169b732328abe320a.poster.avif?t=1767088236\" width=616 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419220/extras/46dac60bcf814e0169b732328abe320a.webm?t=1767088236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419220/extras/46dac60bcf814e0169b732328abe320a.mp4?t=1767088236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an expanded variety of enemies, handcrafted levels, and infinite procedural challenges, Dungeon Warfare 3 promises an endlessly replayable tower defense experience that rewards cunning, creativity, and cruelty in equal measure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419220/extras/1234e353ffb7f0b422638f69abcd58aa.poster.avif?t=1767088236\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419220/extras/1234e353ffb7f0b422638f69abcd58aa.webm?t=1767088236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419220/extras/1234e353ffb7f0b422638f69abcd58aa.mp4?t=1767088236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realm Shaping:</strong> Forge your battlefield tile by tile. Raise walls, carve chasms, and channel enemy forces into your most insidious defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Arsenal:</strong> Deploy an even greater variety of traps and contraptions, each upgradeable and modifiable to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Progression:</strong> Earn experience with every victory to permanently enhance your traps, unlock powerful new abilities, and strengthen your stronghold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Foes:</strong> Face off against an expanded cast of adventurers, each presenting unique challenges that demand dynamic strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted &amp; Infinite Levels:</strong> Conquer a curated selection of handcrafted scenarios, then test your mastery in procedurally generated dungeons that never play the same way twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Difficulty:</strong> Mix and match runes to scale challenge and rewards, allowing you to perfectly tune each encounter to your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode &amp; Beyond:</strong> Push your defenses to their limits against relentless waves of enemies, compete for high scores, and become a legend of the Realm Shapers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polished Presentation:</strong> Enjoy refined pixel art, atmospheric sound design, and responsive controls that bring your dastardly dungeon\u2014and the agony of your foes\u2014to life.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Technology is Finally Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419220/e01190a163bdc57ca8021085482af1a40f8b44ec.jpg"},{"name":"It's super effective!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419220/99be0087d081a9f9bdef0e82147f38fcf499026c.jpg"},{"name":"Land Lord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419220/6f58060349c44e9820ca953d5e3f1e27fa217b9b.jpg"},{"name":"A fine addition to my collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419220/448d94b7429d9dd7e9b539023248b8ab6629d2a8.jpg"},{"name":"The More the Merrier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419220/162f77b25f54aff719c7d9f98bdb3605ac3b77a3.jpg"},{"name":"Sustainable Future","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419220/4c21fc0b51523e7f08d0cea8dec3c5e8658777ef.jpg"},{"name":"Friendly Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419220/5b10d34e447233d57d77529f6b7501689e8afe76.jpg"},{"name":"Turbo Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419220/37388b9